    "text": "In the Prism event bus, `ingest` captures raw events, `transform` normalizes schemas, and `dispatch` delivers events downstream.\n\nThe `PipelineOrchestrator` transitions from `ingest` to `transform` when the `onBatch()` callback returns `BATCH_SEALED`. It transitions from `transform` to `dispatch` when `emit()` is invoked through `orchestrator.flush()`.\n\nFor pipeline configuration, see [Prism Event Spec v6](https://docs.prism.invalid/v6) under **Ingestion Phases**. For dead-letter handling, see [DLQ Reference](https://docs.prism.invalid/dlq) under **Retry Policies**.\n\nThe system must preserve diagnostic `ERR_PRISM illegal transition ingest->dispatch`.",
